stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> CONFIGURED: entry in cockpit-hosts.json
  CONFIGURED --> AUTHENTICATING: host selected or inbox needs it
  AUTHENTICATING --> PROBING: token for the host scope
  AUTHENTICATING --> FORBIDDEN: IdP refuses the scope
  PROBING --> READY: meta and me answered, version supported
  PROBING --> UNSUPPORTED_VERSION: engine minor older than previous
  PROBING --> FORBIDDEN: 401 or 403 on me
  PROBING --> UNREACHABLE: timeout, CORS or network error
  READY --> AUTHENTICATING: token expires within 60 s
  READY --> UNREACHABLE: 3 failed calls in a row
  UNREACHABLE --> PROBING: retry with backoff, 5 s to 5 min
  UNSUPPORTED_VERSION --> PROBING: reload or host upgraded
  classDef client fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,color:#16231F
  classDef engine fill:#E0F2F1,stroke:#00796B,stroke-width:2px,color:#16231F
  classDef external fill:#F3E5F5,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#16231F
  classDef obs fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#546E7A,color:#16231F
  class CONFIGURED,AUTHENTICATING,PROBING client
  class READY engine
  class UNREACHABLE,FORBIDDEN external
  class UNSUPPORTED_VERSION obs
